## Finding

The [original incident page](/kb/incidents/4471) calls this one known
parser issue. The exported classification logic distinguishes a shared
parser problem from a booking-form hint problem. One queued parser fix
does not establish that the hint problem will be fixed.

This review uses the KB export dated 2026-10-04. It does not establish
the current production state by itself. The engineering update below
records the desk's later disposition, not independent verification.

## Engineering disposition · 5 October 2026

The course support desk reports that #4471 closed on 5 October:

- **Parser — fixed:** `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`.
  GitHub issue #1 is closed as completed.
- **Hint — won't fix:** booking-v3 was retired.
  GitHub issue #2 is closed as not planned, not as a delivered hint fix.

The counts below remain the original export's classifications.
The update does not individually verify the unusual reports.

## Original merged snapshot

